@FinanceTrackerApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5174

### 1. Criar uma receita (Income) -> deve devolver 201 Created
POST {{FinanceTrackerApi_HostAddress}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Salário",
  "amount": 1200.00,
  "type": "Income",
  "category": "Trabalho",
  "date": "2026-11-01"
}

### 2. Criar uma despesa (Expense) -> deve devolver 201 Created
POST {{FinanceTrackerApi_HostAddress}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Supermercado",
  "amount": 85.50,
  "type": "Expense",
  "category": "Alimentação",
  "date": "2026-11-05"
}

### 3. Testar validação (valor negativo) -> deve devolver 400 Bad Request
POST {{FinanceTrackerApi_HostAddress}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Erro",
  "amount": -10,
  "type": "Expense",
  "category": "Teste",
  "date": "2026-11-05"
}

### 4. Listar todas as transações -> deve devolver 200 OK
GET {{FinanceTrackerApi_HostAddress}}/api/transactions
Accept: application/json

### 5. Filtrar só despesas -> deve devolver 200 OK
GET {{FinanceTrackerApi_HostAddress}}/api/transactions?type=Expense
Accept: application/json

### 6. Ver resumo financeiro -> deve mostrar saldo de 1114.50
GET {{FinanceTrackerApi_HostAddress}}/api/transactions/summary
Accept: application/json

### 7. Apagar a transação 2 -> deve devolver 204 No Content
DELETE {{FinanceTrackerApi_HostAddress}}/api/transactions/2